    "en": {
      "오일 게이지 | ILJIN 베어링": "Oil Gage | ILJIN Bearing",
      "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Gage Types</p> <h2>오일 게이지</h2> <p>ILJIN이 취급하는 오일 게이지·오일 캡 종류입니다. 아래에서 종류별 도면과 규격을 확인하세요.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Gage Types</p> <h2>Oil Gage</h2> <p>These are the oil gage/oil cap types handled by ILJIN. Check the drawings and specifications by type below.</p>",
      "<a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oilgage_md_mc.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>MD·MC형</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">규격 보기 →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oilgage_mh_mhs.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>MH·MHS형</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">규격 보기 →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oilgage_mhl.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>MHL형</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">규격 보기 →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oil_cap.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>오일 캡</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">규격 보기 →</span> </a>": "<a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oilgage_md_mc.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>MD·MC Type</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View Specifications →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oilgage_mh_mhs.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>MH·MHS Type</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View Specifications →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oilgage_mhl.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>MHL Type</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View Specifications →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oil_cap.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line></svg> <h4>Oil Cap</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View Specifications →</span> </a>",
      "※ 각 종류별 도면과 표는 당사 정식 규격표 원본(sws내지05~09.pdf, 96~98페이지)을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본 또는 견적 문의로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.": "* The drawings and tables for each type are based on our official specification sheet original (sws내지05~09.pdf, pages 96-98). Before precision machining or ordering, please be sure to confirm with the original official specification sheet or a quote inquiry."
    },
    "ja": {
